ock();\n\n// Or create from a JSON structure\nconst json: DirectoryJSON = {\n  '/file.txt': 'Hello, World!',\n  '/dir/nested.txt': 'Nested content',\n};\nconst fs = Superblock.fromJSON(json);\n```\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}